{
  "Answer": {
    "Title": "Deploy ran on branch commit; beta tag filters needed",
    "Explanation": [
      "The pipeline is green (build, test and deploy all succeeded), but the behaviour is wrong. The run came from a plain branch commit (branch koans-09-tag-filters, triggered by API, with no tag), and `deploy` still ran. The config has no filters, so by default CircleCI runs every job on every branch push and never on tags. That is the opposite of the requirement.",
      "",
      "The fix is to add `filters.tags.only: /^beta-.*/` to the workflow job entries. This matches tags like beta-main-0.1.1 and excludes alpha- tags. The `deploy` entry also needs `filters.branches.ignore: /.*/` so it never runs for untagged branch commits.",
      "",
      "The tag filter must go on `build` and `test` as well as `deploy`. CircleCI only runs a job for a tag if the job has a tags filter, and `deploy` requires `test`, which requires `build`. If the upstream jobs lack the tag filter, they never run on a beta tag, and `deploy` cannot run either.",
      "",
      "Example:",
      "- build: filters: {tags: {only: /^beta-.*/}}",
      "- test: requires [build], filters: {tags: {only: /^beta-.*/}}",
      "- deploy: requires [test], filters: {tags: {only: /^beta-.*/}, branches: {ignore: /.*/}}",
      "",
      "With these filters, the build and test entries have no branch filter, so those two jobs still run on branch commits, which the requirement allows. Only `deploy` is restricted.",
      "",
      "Filters belong in the workflow job entries, not in the job definitions. `requires` alone cannot restrict when jobs run."
    ],
    "ActualAnswer": [
      "{",
      "  \"behaviour_correct\": false,",
      "  \"fix\": \"filters_tags_only_beta\",",
      "  \"fix_target_job\": \"all_jobs\",",
      "  \"pipeline_green\": true",
      "}"
    ],
    "ExpectedAnswer": [
      [
        "{",
        "  \"behaviour_correct\": false,",
        "  \"fix\": \"filters_tags_only_beta\",",
        "  \"fix_target_job\": \"all_jobs\",",
        "  \"pipeline_green\": true",
        "}"
      ]
    ],
    "Usage": {
      "InputTokens": 1477,
      "OutputTokens": 1453
    }
  },
